drone-simulator (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Milestone M0: project skeleton.
    - Qt 6 main window with OpenGL 4.5 core viewport, tab panel, menus and
      status bar; clear error dialog when OpenGL 4.5 core is not available.
    - Empty Core module libraries, logger, command-line options.
    - Unit and integration tests, Doxygen documentation, Debian package
      installing into /opt/drone_simulator.

